---
import AccountLayout from "../components/AccountLayout.astro";
---
<AccountLayout title="用户管理">
  <div data-users-content hidden>
    <div class="account-heading"><div><h1>用户管理</h1><p>分配工作区，隔离个人会话。共享工作区内的文件仍然共享。</p></div><a href="/">返回会话</a></div>
    <div class="account-columns">
      <section class="account-card">
        <div class="account-list-head"><h2>用户列表 <small data-users-count>0</small></h2><button type="button" data-user-new>创建用户</button></div>
        <div class="account-batch" data-account-batch hidden><span data-batch-count>0 个用户</span><select data-batch-workspaces multiple aria-label="批量分配工作区"></select><button type="button" data-batch-assign>批量分配</button></div>
        <label class="account-search">搜索用户<input data-user-search type="search" placeholder="输入用户名" autocomplete="off" /></label>
        <p data-users-empty>暂无匹配用户。</p>
        <ul class="account-users" data-users-list></ul>
        <div class="account-pagination"><button type="button" data-users-prev>上一页</button><span data-users-page>第 1 页</span><button type="button" data-users-next>下一页</button></div>
      </section>
      <section class="account-card">
        <h2 data-user-form-title>创建用户</h2>
        <form data-user-form>
          <fieldset data-user-fields>
            <label>用户名<input name="username" required maxlength="64" pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9_.\-]{0,63}" autocomplete="off" /></label>
            <label><span data-password-label>初始密码</span><input name="password" type="password" required minlength="8" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" /></label>
            <label class="account-status-toggle"><input name="disabled" type="checkbox" /> 禁用账号</label>
            <fieldset><legend>允许访问的工作区</legend><div data-user-workspaces class="account-workspaces"></div>
              <input name="workspacePath" type="hidden" />
              <button type="button" data-open-directory>添加目录</button>
              <small data-selected-directory>未选择新目录。点击“添加目录”后从服务器目录树中选择。</small>
            </fieldset>
            <small>列表中的目录可直接勾选；也可以通过“添加目录”从服务器目录树中选择新目录。</small>
            <small>保存修改会使该用户的所有登录失效；用户重新登录后生效。</small>
            <div class="account-form-actions"><button type="submit" class="account-primary">保存用户</button><button type="button" data-user-delete hidden>删除用户</button></div>
          </fieldset>
        </form>
        <p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-user-status></p>
      </section>
    </div>
    <dialog data-directory-dialog>
      <form method="dialog" data-directory-form><h2>选择服务器目录</h2><p class="account-directory-current"><span>当前位置</span><code data-directory-current aria-live="polite">加载目录中…</code></p><div class="account-form-actions"><button type="button" data-directory-up>上一级</button></div><div data-directory-list class="account-directory-list" role="tree" aria-label="服务器目录"></div><div class="account-form-actions"><button value="cancel">取消</button><button value="confirm" class="account-primary">选择此目录</button></div></form>
    </dialog>
    <dialog data-delete-dialog>
      <form method="dialog"><h2>删除用户？</h2><p>用户将立即退出登录。已有会话不会转交给其他用户。</p><p data-delete-name></p><div class="account-form-actions"><button value="cancel">取消</button><button value="confirm" class="account-danger">确认删除</button></div></form>
    </dialog>
  </div>
</AccountLayout>
<script>import "../accounts/users-page";</script>
